Error [E0374]: `comptime` is retired
  --> tests/ui/comptime_keyword_retired.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     comptime answer = 40 + 2
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet folds ordinary foldable expressions automatically; explicit compile-time demand is written with the `$` mark
 Fix: remove the keyword for ordinary code, or write `$name :: …` when failure to compute now must stop the build

Error [E0107]: nothing named `answer` exists here
  --> tests/ui/comptime_keyword_retired.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(answer)
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: a name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: did you mean `$answer`?
